/*******************************
    Open Vis Framework — theme
 *******************************/

/* Minimal, high-leverage overrides of invenio-theme's own site.variables
 * (platform/.venv/lib/*/site-packages/invenio_theme/assets/.../theme/globals/site.variables)
 * — this file is the officially intended per-instance customization
 * hook, loaded after the base theme so these values win. Kept small on
 * purpose: color + typography + corner radius cascade through nearly
 * every component (nav, buttons, cards, borders) for very little
 * surface area to get wrong. See docs/ROADMAP.md.
 */

/*--- Brand color: deep indigo (nav bar, accents, borders) instead of
 * invenio-theme's default muted blue ---*/
@brandColor: #3730a3;

/*--- Typography: a modern system-font stack instead of the default
 * Lato (which isn't actually bundled/imported here, so it was silently
 * falling back to the browser's plain default anyway) - zero network
 * requests, no CSP changes needed. ---*/
@fontName: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;

/*--- Slightly softer corners site-wide ---*/
@defaultBorderRadius: 6px;
